third_party/** linguist-vendored
docs/** linguist-documentation
resources/bandplans/** linguist-data
# Vendor patches are applied byte-for-byte with `git apply` against LF
# upstream sources (cmake/NereusRemoteMedia.cmake). A CRLF checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true on the Windows runner) would add a carriage return to
# every context line and the configure would stop: "patch failed:
# src/agent.c:157". Never convert their line endings.
*.patch -text
